  "readme": "Github link to the original releass + to grab newest updated if available\r\nhttps://github.com/xexpoiiison/DayBreak-Engine-Releases\r\n\r\nMenu by XeXPoiiison\r\n\r\n1. Copy DayBreak.sprx to /data/GoldHEN/plugins/\r\n\r\n2. Add it to /data/GoldHEN/plugins.ini:\r\n[CUSA02290]\r\n/data/GoldHEN/plugins/DayBreak.sprx\r\n\r\n3. Start the game with plugins enabled in\r\n\r\nControls\r\nInput\tAction\r\nL1 + D-pad Right\tOpen / close the menu\r\nL1 / R1\tPrevious / next tab\r\nD-pad Up / Down\tMove\r\nD-pad Left / Right\tChange a value\r\nX\tSelect\r\nO\tBack / close\r\n\r\nSave Config (Style tab) keeps your settings. The name and clan tag choices are not saved.\r\n\r\nA stuck \"retry or cancel\" cryptokeys prompt is cleared with Stats & Unlocks > Cryptokeys > Reset Cryptokeys.",
